01:26:46.796 --> 01:26:50.396
SPENDING. THE AVERAGE LOCATION SHOOT ADDS

01:26:52.135 --> 01:26:53.536
$670,000 AND 1500 JOBS A DAY INTO THE LOCAL ECONOMY FOR

01:26:53.536 --> 01:26:57.600
